<title>BELGIUM: EU monetary panel did not discuss lira ERM entry.</title>
<headline>EU monetary panel did not discuss lira ERM entry.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's monetary committee did not discuss the possible entry of the Italian lira into the Exchange Rate Mechanism, EU monetary sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;The lira was not discussed, but I think it's coming,&quot; said one source familiar with the committee's deliberations.</p>
<p>The committee met on Tuesday to discuss a wide range of issues pertaining to economic and monetary union (EMU) and will gather again next week for further talks, sources added.</p>
<p>Speculation on the lira's near-term entry into the ERM has been fuelled by official statements and the parliamentary passage of Italy's 1997 budget.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6830</p>
